/// Loads the real Roboto faces before any test runs.
///
/// Widget tests default to the synthetic `FlutterTest` font, which paints
/// every glyph as a solid box, so golden captures show squares instead of
/// letters. Loading the fonts shipped in `test/fonts/` under the `Roboto`
/// family — the family Material resolves on the default (Android) test
